stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued
  queued --> running : 消费者取到消息
  queued --> cancelled : 用户取消
  running --> succeeded : 全部成功
  running --> partial_failed : 部分失败
  running --> failed : 整体失败
  partial_failed --> running : 重试失败项
  failed --> running : 重试
  failed --> dead : 超过 3 次（30s / 2m / 8m）
  dead --> running : 运维重放（写审计）
  succeeded --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
